WEBVTT

00:04:27.142 --> 00:04:30.208
Edhe kjo nje form lufte eshte, nje toger duke thene,

00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.868
"Te lutem le te ndodh dicka

00:04:32.868 --> 00:04:34.911
sepse po cmendemi."

00:04:34.911 --> 00:04:37.259
Per te kuptuar ate,

00:04:37.259 --> 00:04:39.169
ju duhet qe per nje moment,

00:04:39.169 --> 00:04:41.570
te mendoni per luften jo moralisht--

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.455
kjo eshte shume e rendesishme --

00:04:43.455 --> 00:04:45.348
por per nje moment, mos mendoni per te moralisht,

00:04:45.348 --> 00:04:48.219
mendoni per te neurologjikisht.

00:04:48.219 --> 00:04:50.431
Te mendojme se cka ndodh ne trurin tuaj

00:04:50.431 --> 00:04:52.804
kur jeni ne lufte.

00:04:52.804 --> 00:04:55.156
Se pari, pervoja

00:04:55.156 --> 00:04:59.770
eshte shume e tmershme, eshte me e tmershmja.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.760
Nuk eshte absolutish c'ka kisha pritur une.